[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0010","text":"──然后，下周是外景拍摄\n要过夜，做好准备啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0020","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0030","text":"去哪儿来着\n目的地"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0040","text":"……刚才球打到的地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0050","text":"啊\n村子啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0060","text":"外景的流程已经定下来了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0070","text":"大致流程还在踩点阶段讨论中"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0080","text":"正式拍摄前应该会定下来\n到时候照着走就行──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0090","text":"————哒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0100","text":"抱歉，没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0110","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0120","text":"……好像正在施工呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0130","text":"啊，我没注意到\n是禁止通行啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0140","text":"没有吗？\n路"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0150","text":"嗯\n只能绕路了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0160","text":"要绕远路了，抱歉\n累了的话可以睡一会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0170","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0180","text":"路"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0190","text":"没有路的地方\n的，前方是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060300_02_0200","text":"────……好暗啊"}]
